note contract 5 abstract, lines 131-150: dup32 with the exact constructor body (check erased),
note open gives the ulong value, rotr is a 64-bit rotation equal to the dup of the 32-bit rotation
note by n mod 32 (lines 140-141), xor of two dup32 values. stdout oracle exp/a5-exact.out (python3).
om2
abstract dup32 ulong ops rotr xor
holds dup32 dup32
fn dup32mk x uint to dup32
ret seal dup32 or shl ulong x 32 ulong x
end
fn main to int
d = dup32mk 0x89abcdef
puth open d
puth add open d 1
puth open rotr d 0
puth open rotr d 1
puth open rotr d 8
puth open rotr d 31
puth open rotr d 32
puth open rotr d 33
puth open rotr d 63
puth open xor d dup32mk 0x01234567
ret 0
end
